OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mix of
OL,6,Fclear spells and spots of rain,
OL,7,Fbecoming clearer and drier by sunrise
OL,8,Fperhaps with an isolated shower. A
OL,9,Fcooler night than last night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,12,Ffor many with sunny spells. The odd
OL,13,Fshower possible, mainly towards the
OL,14,Fnorthwest. Temperatures nearer average.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBreezy
OL,17,Fwith spells of rain on Friday and
OL,18,FSaturday, potentially heavy at times.
OL,19,FDrier with brighter on Sunday.
OL,20,FTemperatures remain near or a little
OL,21,Fabove average for early October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
